<title>CANADA: Canada new housing price index falls in Aug.</title>
<headline>Canada new housing price index falls in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's new housing price index fell 2.2 percent in August to 131.5 (base 1986) from August 1995, Statistics Canada said on Friday.</p>
<p>    Index			 Aug	yr pct  month pct</p>
<p> Total			    131.5     -2.2	    NA</p>
<p> House only		     121.1     -2.4	    NA</p>
<p> Land only			165.3     -1.3	  -0.2</p>
<p>The index measures changes of contractors' selling prices of new residential houses.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Ottawa Bureau 613-235-6745</p>
</text>
